`stored` = the server certificate Command Center pinned for a partner or Platform Server; `system` = Command Center / Internet Server
own key; `probed` = read from a live TLS handshake during the export (the Internet Server HTTPS keystore is not exposed by REST).
Platform Server connections trust the *stored* certificate: when the remote side renews its certificate the stored one must be refreshed.
